# Hub API: the database is built from hub/data/reference/seed/ (first request or image build).
# The seed is processed Deutsche Börse data: it must not be published (this repo is public).
# Get it from a teammate or build it from the raw ZIP (hub/scripts/build.sh); to the server by scp/rsync, never via git.
hub/data/reference/seed/
# real API responses and raw values used by the tests, and the dataset notes: same data, local only
hub/tests/fixtures/
hub/docs/data_dictionary.md
# events.csv holds tagesschau.de headlines, which may not be republished; the API reads events from the seed.
hub/data/reference/events.csv
hub/data/hub.duckdb*
hub/data/*.seeding
hub/.env
hub/.venv/
# Raw Deutsche Börse files and cached event-source responses (pipeline input, never published)
hub/data/raw/
hub/data/raw_events/

